                                                "sense_id": "d9090180-6fa0-3d44-b4af-3caf43fd77e9",
                                                "text": "When Danna Walker left the second-floor conference room and returned tearily to her desk — where someone had already deposited a packing box for her belongings — her first thought was not of the 14 years she had worked for DHL or the loss of her $37,000-a-year salary."
